                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Below are the overall numbers for the last five seasons combined. These figures give a quick snapshot of the scale of competition and reliability challenges during this period.</run>
