        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3867' id='38' type-v2='text' w='99308' x='538' y='29267'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>The figures above summarise the overall scale of competition between 2020 and 2024. During this period, drivers scored more than 10,000 points in total, achieved over 100 race wins, and stood on the podium more than 300 times.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>At the same time, more than 300 races ended in retirement. These DNFs highlight how reliability remained a critical factor alongside pure performance.</run>
